OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe protesters displaying
OL,4,Aterror and neo-Nazi banners
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating claims
OL,7,Fdemonstrators displayed the flag of a
OL,8,Fproscribed terrorist organisation
OL,9,Falongside neo-Nazi paraphernalia in
OL,10,FEdinburgh.
OL,12,FVideos circulating on social media show
OL,13,Fa group of men holding up a flag
OL,14,Fbearing the name of the Ulster Defence
OL,15,FAssociation (UDA) during a protest on
OL,16,FPrinces Street on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
