OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe protesters displaying
OL,4,Aterror and neo-Nazi banners
OL,5,
OL,6,FImages also show some of the men
OL,7,Fcarrying a banner bearing the logo of
OL,8,FCombat 18, the neo-Nazi group, and the
OL,9,Ffar-right organisations Patriotic
OL,10,FAlternative and the Scottish Defence
OL,11,FLeague.
OL,13,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said it
OL,14,Fwas "aware" of the images and videos
OL,15,Fposted online, adding inquiries were
OL,16,Fongoing.
